---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Contact TableScore"
  description="How to reach the operator of this score keeper. This sandbox has no message form and collects no addresses."
  path="/contact/"
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>This copy of TableScore is a local sandbox. It has no server, so there is no form that can send a message and no address book that can store one.</p>
    <p>When a public site is launched, this page will list a real operator address. Until then, treat this page as a placeholder with honest limits: nothing you type here would go anywhere, so the page does not ask you to type.</p>
    <p>Scores and player names never leave the browser. See <a href="/privacy/">privacy</a>.</p>
    <p>Owner of this sandbox: Robert. Working title only — no public domain has been attached to this build.</p>
    <p><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/hand-and-foot-score-keeper/">Hand and Foot score keeper</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
